---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mar Azul Fact Check | Coyol Real Estate">
  <article class="fact-check">
    <header class="header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Coyol</a>
      <h1>Mar Azul</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Permits & Compliance</p>
    </header>

    <div class="content">
      
      <section class="intro">
        <p>Mar Azul is a legally registered condominium with all required permits and authorizations from Costa Rican authorities.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="permits">
        <h2>Permits & Authorizations</h2>
        
        <div class="permit-grid">
          
          <div class="permit-card">
            <div class="permit-icon">🏛️</div>
            <h3>Registered Condominium</h3>
            <p class="permit-number">Finca 5-370-M-000</p>
            <p class="permit-detail">Cédula jurídica 3-109-895251</p>
          </div>

          <div class="permit-card">
            <div class="permit-icon">💧</div>
            <h3>Water Concession</h3>
            <p class="permit-number">R-2133-2024-AGUAS-MINAE</p>
            <p class="permit-detail">MINAE · 10 years · September 2024</p>
          </div>

          <div class="permit-card">
            <div class="permit-icon">🌿</div>
            <h3>Environmental Approval</h3>
            <p class="permit-number">SETENA 2514-2019 & 1413-2024</p>
            <p class="permit-detail">Full environmental impact assessment</p>
          </div>

          <div class="permit-card">
            <div class="permit-icon">🏗️</div>
            <h3>Municipal Construction Permit</h3>
            <p class="permit-number">PC-714-2023</p>
            <p class="permit-detail">Municipalidad de Nicoya · 23,917 m²</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="electricity">
        <h2>Electrical Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>Mar Azul is working with ICE to build a public primary electrical line that will replace the existing private connection. This upgrade affects only the external delivery lines — internal electrical systems remain unchanged.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="contact">
        <p>Questions? <a href="/#contact">Contact us</a></p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <footer class="page-footer">
      <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .fact-check {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    color: #1A1F16;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .content {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: #F5F3EF;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #1A1F16;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #3D4F3D;
  }

  .permit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .permit-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .permit-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .permit-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #1A1F16;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .permit-number {
    font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .permit-detail {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .electricity p {
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact a {
    color: #3D4F3D;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .page-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .permit-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
